  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 189d3e3b081dcc84aa2f60926508fda9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Azaus
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Azaus, The Untiring
  descriptionEnglish: '"Azaus is not necessarily a good being, but due to his relentless
    hunt for demons and his hatred for them, he has gained a positive reputation
    for helping humans. The only issue is that he seems to not care much about the
    well-being of the people around him.



    Once, he destroyed an entire village
    to kill a demon spider..."'
  nameChinese: "\u963F\u624E\u65AF\uFF0C\u4E0D\u77E5\u75B2\u5026\u8005"
  descriptionChinese: "Azaus\u4E0D\u80FD\u8BF4\u662F\u4EC0\u4E48\u5927\u597D\u4EBA\uFF0C\u4E0D\u8FC7\u7531\u4E8E\u4ED6\u5BF9\u6076\u9B54\u7684\u65E0\u5C3D\u618E\u6068\u548C\u65E0\u6B62\u5883\u5730\u8FFD\u6740\uFF0C\u4ED6\u8FD8\u662F\u83B7\u5F97\u4E86\u52A9\u4EBA\u4E3A\u4E50\u7684\u540D\u58F0\u3002\u552F\u4E00\u7684\u95EE\u9898\u662F\u4ED6\u4F3C\u4E4E\u4E5F\u4E0D\u592A\u5173\u5FC3\u4EBA\u7C7B\u7684\u5B89\u5168\u3002\u66FE\u7ECF\uFF0C\u4ED6\u4E3A\u4E86\u62CD\u6B7B\u4E00\u53EA\u5C0F\u5C0F\u7684\u6076\u9B54\u8718\u86DB\uFF0C\u6467\u6BC1\u4E86\u4E00\u6574\u4E2A\u5C0F\u9547\u3002"
  namePortuguese: "Azaus, O Incans\xE1vel"
  descriptionPortuguese: "Azaus n\xE3o \xE9 necessariamente uma criatura boa, mas
    devido \xE0 sua ca\xE7ada implac\xE1vel aos dem\xF4nios e ao \xF3dio que sente
    por eles, acabou ganhando uma reputa\xE7\xE3o positiva por ajudar os humanos.\nO
    \xFAnico problema \xE9 que ele parece n\xE3o se importar muito com o bem-estar
    das pessoas ao seu redor.\n\nCerta vez, ele destruiu uma vila inteira s\xF3 para
    matar uma aranha demon\xEDaca..."
  nameSpanish: Azaus, El Incansable
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Azaus no es necesariamente un ser bueno, pero debido
    a su incansable caza de demonios y su odio hacia ellos, ha ganado una reputaci\xF3n
    positiva por ayudar a los humanos. El \xFAnico problema es que parece no preocuparse
    mucho por el bienestar de las personas a su alrededor. Una vez, destruy\xF3 todo
    un pueblo para matar a una ara\xF1a demon\xEDaca..."
  shortName: Azaus
